1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,441
Look at your own body.

2
00:00:01,441 --> 00:00:05,488
Roughly half of the nitrogen atoms holding your proteins together did

3
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:07,483
not come from the air you breathe,

4
00:00:07,483 --> 00:00:09,829
or the food your ancestors grew by hand.

5
00:00:09,829 --> 00:00:11,296
They came from a factory.

6
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:12,296
One invention,

7
00:00:12,296 --> 00:00:15,757
built in a few years at the start of the twentieth century,

8
00:00:15,757 --> 00:00:18,338
rewired the chemistry of the entire planet —

9
00:00:18,338 --> 00:00:21,623
and it began with a question nobody could answer: how do

10
00:00:21,623 --> 00:00:23,441
you pull bread out of thin air?

